        <mxCell id="yTBpajKAJuariRbWI2m5-8" value="#5 As a User Admin, I want to suspend user accounts&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;so that I can enforce platform rules&lt;/span&gt;" style="text;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;" parent="1" vertex="1">
