        <mxCell id="1p-HA8RJE_JukbmLBKhe-1" value="#12 As a User Admin, I want to suspend user profiles so that there will not be unused user profiles" style="text;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="973.5" y="5274.69" width="524" height="41" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="1p-HA8RJE_JukbmLBKhe-2" value="&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;Use Case: Suspend User Profiles&lt;/span&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;Actor: User Admin&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;Description: User Admin can suspend a user profile to prevent future account creations or temporarily deactivate a category that is not in use&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;Trigger: User Admin clicks on &quot;Suspend&quot; button next to user profile&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;Preconditions:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;- User Admin is logged into the system&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;- At least one user profile type exists in the system&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;div&gt;- User Admin selects the profile type they want to suspend&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;- System displays the profile type details&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;Normal flow:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;div&gt;1. User Admin clicks &quot;Suspend Profile Type&quot; button&#39;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;2. System shows a confirmation prompt&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;3. User Admin confirms suspension&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;4. System updates the status of selected profile type to &quot;Suspended&quot;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;Alternate flow:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;1a. System error&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;- System displays error message &quot;Failed to update user profile status due to a server error.&quot;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="964" y="6022.69" width="573.5" height="381.31" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
