        <mxCell id="BrMUS-PM0ypTzJZhfawy-1" value="#14 As a User Admin, I want to log in to different user profiles so that I can ensure features and information are relevant to the profile" style="text;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="3914.5" y="1348.94" width="524" height="41" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="BrMUS-PM0ypTzJZhfawy-2" value="&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;Use Case ID: UA14&lt;/span&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;Actor: User Admin&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;Description: User Admin can temporarily log in or switch to different user profile types in order to verify features and content shown appropriate for that role&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;Preconditions:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;- User Admin is authenticated and has access to profile simulation functionality&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;- User profiles must already exist in the system&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;- User Admin must already be in the &quot;User Profiles Simulation&quot; page&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;- User Admin must pick target user profile&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;Normal flow:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;1. The system switches to a simulated view of the selected user profile&#39;s dashboard/interface&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;2. User Admin reviews content and features&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;Alternate flow:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;1. If there is an error loading the simulated user profile interface, the system will display &quot;Unable to simulate this user profile, please try again later&quot;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="3900" y="2087.94" width="573.5" height="309.06" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
