        <mxCell id="oDsTDifMXU8W_QaUGRU--64" value="&lt;font face=&quot;Ubuntu-Regular, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif&quot; color=&quot;#2e3440&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;#24 As a Cleaner, I want to search for my confirmed matches so I know who to work for&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;" style="text;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="68.5" y="9472" width="399" height="37" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="oDsTDifMXU8W_QaUGRU--65" value="&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;Use Case:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;Search Confirmed Matches&lt;/span&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;Actor: Cleaner&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;Description: Cleaner can search and filter their confirmed service matches to keep track of upcoming jobs and know which homeowners they are assigned to&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;Trigger: Cleaner clicks &quot;Apply&quot; to search for confirmed matches&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;Preconditions:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;- Cleaner must be logged in&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;- Cleaner must have at least one confirmed match&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;- Cleaner must already be at &quot;Confirmed Matches&quot;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;Normal flow:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;1. Cleaner inputs search terms or applies filters e.g date, service category&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;2. The system displays a list of matching confirmed bookings&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;Alternate flow:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;1a. No listings match the search criteria or filter&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;- The system displays &quot;No confirmed matches found for selected filters&quot;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;1b. System error&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;- System displays error message &quot;Failed to retrieve confirmed matches due to a server error.&quot;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="15.5" y="10216.69" width="573.5" height="353.31" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
